WEBVTT

01:30.280 --> 01:33.800
ADAPTED FROM THE BLOSSOMING LOVE
BY SUI YU ER AN ON ICEREAD.COM

01:52.360 --> 01:54.920
This Graceful Palace is beautiful,
no doubt,

01:56.080 --> 01:59.160
but I haven't seen Zhao Ming
for several days.

01:59.240 --> 02:00.440
Is he really that busy?

02:01.920 --> 02:04.440
The Saint Emperor's time
belongs to the people.

02:04.520 --> 02:05.360
Of course, he's busy.

02:07.800 --> 02:09.120
Didn't you say

02:09.199 --> 02:11.480
you're the one he can't live without?

02:11.560 --> 02:12.480
Why are you so free, then?

02:13.480 --> 02:14.320
I…

02:15.520 --> 02:16.400
I have important duties to attend to!

02:19.560 --> 02:20.400
What important duties?

02:21.760 --> 02:22.920
Well…

02:25.200 --> 02:27.560
Important duties
can't be casually spoken about.

02:28.760 --> 02:29.840
Don't you understand?

02:32.200 --> 02:33.880
If you're bored,

02:33.960 --> 02:35.680
I have a way to entertain you.

02:37.720 --> 02:38.920
What's the new game this time?

02:40.560 --> 02:43.200
Dice betting. It's all about the thrill.

02:45.040 --> 02:46.120
The rules are simple.

02:52.080 --> 02:53.160
Do you understand them?

02:56.480 --> 02:57.360
One round, and you'll get it.

02:58.240 --> 03:00.880
However, you need
to bet something valuable.

03:11.600 --> 03:15.200
This is my most precious possession,
yesterday's peach blossom pastry.

03:15.800 --> 03:17.400
I've been saving it until now.

03:18.200 --> 03:20.440
Then, I'll bet it.

03:23.560 --> 03:24.880
This is far too precious.

03:25.520 --> 03:26.960
Just use something ordinary to bet.

03:28.240 --> 03:29.240
For instance,

03:29.760 --> 03:32.680
the jewelry box that the Saint Emperor
gifted you a few days ago.

03:44.000 --> 03:45.120
Your Majesty,

03:45.840 --> 03:46.920
you haven't slept in days.

03:47.000 --> 03:48.440
-Why not rest for a while?
-It's fine.

03:52.720 --> 03:54.440
He Zhou visits the Graceful Palace daily.

03:55.040 --> 03:56.440
The Chaos Pearl shows nothing unusual

03:57.360 --> 03:58.480
or any strange activity.

03:59.840 --> 04:01.480
Although it is an ancient artifact,

04:02.000 --> 04:03.600
it has taken human form now

04:04.120 --> 04:05.160
and should be treated as such.

04:06.120 --> 04:06.960
Understood.

04:11.960 --> 04:14.880
Pearl is pure, and He Zhou is loyal.

04:15.400 --> 04:17.160
They're a good match as companions.

04:17.240 --> 04:18.880
Come on.
A little gambling is harmless fun.

04:18.959 --> 04:20.720
Bet big, win big. Bet small, win small!

04:20.800 --> 04:21.839
Small… It's definitely small!

04:21.920 --> 04:23.480
-Quick, open it!
-Three, two, one, open!

04:24.960 --> 04:26.720
You bet small, but it's big.

04:26.800 --> 04:29.880
These hairpins are mine now.

04:30.400 --> 04:31.600
How about it? Still playing?

04:31.680 --> 04:32.640
One more round!

04:34.960 --> 04:37.240
-One more round!
-I love your straightforward style!

04:37.840 --> 04:38.680
Don't lose heart.

04:38.760 --> 04:41.160
Play a few more rounds,
and I'll teach you properly.

04:42.200 --> 04:43.320
Why not teach me too?

04:44.360 --> 04:45.400
Your Majesty…

04:46.560 --> 04:47.600
Zhao Ming!

04:48.440 --> 04:49.360
Pearl.

04:51.320 --> 04:52.960
-Sit.
-Why is the Saint Emperor here?

04:53.040 --> 04:54.280
Why didn't you warn me?

05:05.040 --> 05:06.200
Let's begin.

05:06.280 --> 05:08.200
Your Majesty, is this really appropriate?

05:09.800 --> 05:11.600
Just go ahead.

05:26.280 --> 05:28.560
This is my bet. Is it sufficient?

05:29.200 --> 05:30.520
Don't blame me for being weak-willed.

05:31.440 --> 05:34.240
Your Majesty bet too much!

05:35.000 --> 05:36.280
Let's begin.

05:44.280 --> 05:45.760
It's all gone.

05:46.280 --> 05:47.960
I'm done playing.

05:51.040 --> 05:53.400
Pearl, have you learned it?

05:57.320 --> 05:59.560
Pearl hasn't learned it.
So, let's continue.

06:00.720 --> 06:03.080
Your Majesty, this isn't fair.

06:03.720 --> 06:05.280
I've already lost everything.

06:05.360 --> 06:06.440
It's fine.

06:07.040 --> 06:09.600
Next month's allowance
can be advanced for your bets.

06:10.800 --> 06:13.360
Didn't you say a little gambling
is harmless fun?

06:14.800 --> 06:16.200
I still want to learn.

06:16.840 --> 06:19.640
A gamble is a gamble.
Big or small, it's harmful!

06:19.720 --> 06:20.880
Pearl, don't pick up bad habits.

06:25.240 --> 06:27.000
I, He Zhou,
swear off gambling starting today.

06:27.080 --> 06:28.560
I'll never involve Pearl again.

06:31.720 --> 06:34.720
Yan, issue the order.

06:34.800 --> 06:37.320
From today onward,
gambling is banned in the palace.

06:38.320 --> 06:39.360
Understood.

06:40.360 --> 06:41.400
You may leave now.

06:42.520 --> 06:43.480
Understood.

06:54.240 --> 06:55.280
Pearl,

06:56.400 --> 06:57.960
keep these winnings safe.

06:58.560 --> 07:00.320
Don't let He Zhou trick you again.

07:01.760 --> 07:02.600
It's not He Zhou's fault.

07:02.680 --> 07:05.600
These days, he's always
been keeping me company.

07:10.560 --> 07:12.600
When I was still a pearl,

07:12.680 --> 07:15.040
I could see you anytime.

07:15.120 --> 07:16.840
But now that I'm human,

07:17.400 --> 07:19.360
it's hard to even catch a glimpse of you.

07:20.000 --> 07:21.400
It's something I'm not used to.

07:27.560 --> 07:28.880
That's my oversight.

07:29.640 --> 07:31.600
You've just taken human form.

07:32.200 --> 07:33.880
There must be many things
you're adjusting to.

07:35.920 --> 07:37.880
But if you stick with He Zhou
for too long,

07:39.120 --> 07:40.680
he could misguide you.

07:42.200 --> 07:43.960
I'll find you a teacher

07:44.920 --> 07:46.680
to teach you reading and writing.

07:46.760 --> 07:47.800
How does that sound?

07:50.280 --> 07:51.440
A teacher?

08:08.760 --> 08:10.040
The essence of sunlight and moonlight

08:10.120 --> 08:12.440
is indeed beneficial
for refining spiritual pills,

08:12.520 --> 08:14.000
but the process is lengthy.

08:15.120 --> 08:16.120
Recently, I've discovered

08:16.200 --> 08:18.960
another kind of vital energy in this world

08:19.040 --> 08:21.480
that can accelerate the process
of refining spiritual pills.

08:31.480 --> 08:32.600
Sir,

08:33.240 --> 08:36.039
I'm sorry for being late
and keeping you waiting.

08:38.080 --> 08:39.080
It's fine.

08:41.679 --> 08:43.120
A brief wait is nothing,

08:44.400 --> 08:45.840
as long as you've arrived.

08:55.400 --> 08:59.120
Zhao Ming said you're
the most learned scholar in all of Dongze.

08:59.200 --> 09:02.200
What's more, you offered
to teach me yourself.

09:02.880 --> 09:03.720
Thank you, Sir.

09:05.520 --> 09:07.000
No need for such formality.

09:07.560 --> 09:09.200
It makes us seem distant.

09:10.680 --> 09:12.080
Hearing this from you puts me at ease.

09:12.680 --> 09:14.480
It's all He Zhou's fault for scaring me,

09:14.560 --> 09:16.960
saying I must act with utmost respect

09:17.040 --> 09:19.480
or risk getting my palms struck
with a ruler by the teacher.

09:19.560 --> 09:21.000
But I think

09:21.520 --> 09:23.800
you make me feel very approachable.

09:24.320 --> 09:26.760
What's the saying for that?

09:28.520 --> 09:29.440
Like meeting an old friend at first sight.

09:37.520 --> 09:38.840
Like meeting an old friend at first sight?

09:41.320 --> 09:43.000
Did you recall

09:43.520 --> 09:44.920
an old friend

09:45.800 --> 09:46.840
or a familiar place?

09:51.000 --> 09:52.320
Sir, you must be joking.

09:52.400 --> 09:54.480
I'm just a pearl of Zhao Ming.

09:54.560 --> 09:56.160
How could I have old friends?

09:58.600 --> 10:00.080
Let's begin the lesson.

10:00.160 --> 10:03.000
Today, we'll start
with some basic characters.

10:09.240 --> 10:10.240
This character is pronounced
as "ren," meaning "human,"

10:11.680 --> 10:13.240
which is also your current identity.

10:16.120 --> 10:16.960
"Ren."

10:17.040 --> 10:18.680
HUMAN

10:19.840 --> 10:21.880
This character is simple
and easy to remember.

10:30.440 --> 10:32.640
This character is pronounced
as "tian," meaning "heaven."

10:33.160 --> 10:34.440
Here's how you can remember it.

10:36.160 --> 10:37.800
"Heaven" has two extra horizontal lines
compared to "human."

10:37.880 --> 10:39.400
One line stands above "human,"

10:39.920 --> 10:41.200
and the other confines "human."

10:43.040 --> 10:44.080
"Tian"…

10:45.040 --> 10:46.600
Why is it so domineering?

10:48.880 --> 10:50.800
That's the order of the world.

10:51.320 --> 10:52.760
Heaven is always above humanity.

10:53.280 --> 10:54.560
Humanity is subjected to heaven.

10:57.000 --> 10:58.440
Then, I don't like heaven.

10:58.960 --> 11:00.400
It makes people suffer,

11:01.000 --> 11:03.160
and it keeps Zhao Ming too busy
to spend time with me.

11:06.040 --> 11:07.600
Companionship among humans

11:09.320 --> 11:10.720
lasts just decades at most.

11:11.680 --> 11:13.320
Only those from the heavens

11:13.840 --> 11:15.720
can share eternity with heaven.

11:17.040 --> 11:18.400
That kind of companionship

11:19.120 --> 11:20.960
is truly everlasting.

11:24.880 --> 11:27.280
But even if the time together
lasts long, what's the point?

11:28.760 --> 11:31.840
If two people stay together
but feel unhappy,

11:32.600 --> 11:34.040
isn't that kind of companionship

11:34.120 --> 11:35.600
a source of pain?

11:50.760 --> 11:51.840
Sir.

12:00.800 --> 12:03.840
I made these pastries
with the kitchen staff.

12:04.360 --> 12:05.960
I brought them over just for you to try.

12:08.720 --> 12:11.320
Sir, why are you upset today?

12:11.960 --> 12:14.000
Is it because I'm too slow
at learning characters?

12:14.520 --> 12:15.440
Or do you think I'm stupid?

12:16.040 --> 12:17.480
I'm not upset.

12:18.520 --> 12:20.760
You have a sharp mind
and grasp things quickly.

12:21.280 --> 12:22.480
How could you be stupid?

12:25.400 --> 12:26.760
I'm glad you're not upset, Sir.

12:27.360 --> 12:29.560
So, tomorrow,
will you still teach me characters?

12:37.120 --> 12:38.440
Now that you're human,

12:38.960 --> 12:41.240
finding simple and pure happiness

12:41.320 --> 12:42.200
is a blessing in itself.

12:44.760 --> 12:45.840
Open this.

12:54.520 --> 12:56.120
This jade pen is for you.

12:56.640 --> 12:57.960
Heaven controls humanity,

12:58.040 --> 12:59.040
but with a pen in hand,

12:59.120 --> 13:01.080
one can write their own destiny.

13:03.440 --> 13:04.440
Thank you, Sir.

13:07.360 --> 13:08.400
Well then,

13:08.920 --> 13:10.240
I'll take my leave.

13:10.320 --> 13:11.760
Don't forget to try the pastries.

13:20.160 --> 13:22.360
Why did you gather these items?
What are they for?

13:23.640 --> 13:26.600
Why do people use flowers
on so many different occasions?

13:27.120 --> 13:28.800
Weddings, funerals,

13:28.880 --> 13:30.240
and offerings to the deities…

13:30.760 --> 13:32.360
These seemingly unrelated events

13:32.880 --> 13:35.160
are all connected by flowers
as tokens of emotion.

13:36.320 --> 13:37.160
Flowers…

13:37.240 --> 13:39.440
To us, they are either black or white,

13:39.960 --> 13:42.200
with only slight differences in form.

13:42.280 --> 13:43.560
But in the eyes of mortals,

13:43.640 --> 13:45.840
flowers are vastly distinct,

13:45.920 --> 13:48.040
vividly colorful,
each carrying its own meaning.

13:48.760 --> 13:51.120
Every time I look down
from the sea of clouds,

13:51.200 --> 13:52.880
I see children's faces light up with joy

13:53.400 --> 13:54.920
just from eating one.

13:55.000 --> 13:56.480
A simple pastry

13:56.560 --> 13:58.200
can bring them happiness.

13:59.600 --> 14:00.640
Yet, we cannot feel that.

14:02.560 --> 14:03.920
To us,

14:04.440 --> 14:06.760
all food is tasteless.

14:07.360 --> 14:09.600
We've never experienced
all kinds of flavors

14:10.120 --> 14:11.760
or the longing tied to them.

14:11.840 --> 14:13.120
Why, then, should we feel sorrow?

14:13.960 --> 14:15.480
The logic is clear.

14:15.560 --> 14:16.920
If we've never had it,

14:17.000 --> 14:18.440
there's no longing tied to it.

14:19.600 --> 14:21.120
We, as divine artifacts,

14:21.640 --> 14:22.760
may share heaven's longevity

14:23.360 --> 14:24.560
and enjoy the respect of the deities,

14:24.640 --> 14:27.000
but we are no more than tools of Hao Tian.

14:27.520 --> 14:29.400
Our lives are less colorful
than those of mortals.

14:33.440 --> 14:35.440
Hao Tian bestowed divine power upon us,

14:35.960 --> 14:38.320
but it came with absolute fairness.

14:39.080 --> 14:40.600
We are forbidden to favor anything.

14:41.320 --> 14:43.480
What we gain

14:44.440 --> 14:46.600
is destined to come at a price.

14:46.680 --> 14:49.520
Yet, we can't taste flavors,

14:49.600 --> 14:51.400
see colors,

14:52.200 --> 14:53.760
smell the fragrance of flowers,

14:55.960 --> 14:56.880
or understand emotions.

14:58.000 --> 14:59.200
For tens of thousands of years,

14:59.720 --> 15:01.200
every day has been the same.

15:02.720 --> 15:03.560
Fate,

15:04.680 --> 15:05.720
don't you find it boring?

15:10.240 --> 15:11.160
All things in this world

15:12.200 --> 15:13.440
are bound by cause and effect.

15:14.160 --> 15:15.760
This is the price of being an artifact.

15:18.000 --> 15:19.720
Will the next 10,000 years

15:20.240 --> 15:21.400
or even a million years

15:22.600 --> 15:23.440
be the same?

15:32.480 --> 15:33.360
It's fate.

15:39.560 --> 15:41.280
We must remain loyal to Hao Tian.

15:50.680 --> 15:51.720
Sir,

15:52.240 --> 15:53.320
just now, outside the hall,

15:53.400 --> 15:56.400
Miss Pearl said
this was her first time making pastries.

15:57.200 --> 15:58.280
How do they taste?

16:00.720 --> 16:01.840
Very sweet.

16:05.920 --> 16:08.040
But Miss Pearl said

16:08.120 --> 16:10.480
today's batch was supposed to be savory.

16:17.800 --> 16:19.120
-Is that so?
-True.

16:19.200 --> 16:21.000
The recipe for these pastries is unique.

16:21.080 --> 16:23.160
It's a tradition from my homeland.

16:27.200 --> 16:29.080
So, it's something from your homeland.

16:29.600 --> 16:31.280
No wonder you treasure it so much.

16:32.960 --> 16:34.760
Come, have a taste yourself.

16:36.640 --> 16:37.760
Thank you, Sir.

16:50.160 --> 16:51.600
Tasting this pastry

16:53.680 --> 16:54.640
has made me suddenly homesick.

16:58.160 --> 17:00.520
Luckily, there are people from my homeland

17:01.040 --> 17:02.520
in the palace to keep me company.

17:05.280 --> 17:06.280
Zi Chen,

17:07.520 --> 17:08.760
I'd like to consult you on a question.

17:12.000 --> 17:12.839
I don't dare.

17:13.359 --> 17:16.240
How could I deserve to be consulted

17:16.319 --> 17:19.040
when you know everything?

17:19.119 --> 17:20.040
Please, just ask.

17:23.040 --> 17:25.839
If you had someone from your homeland,

17:26.599 --> 17:28.720
and you were supposed
to take her back there,

17:30.760 --> 17:34.320
but that place was full of restrictions,
cold and desolate,

17:35.120 --> 17:37.640
there's no freedom and no joy,

17:38.440 --> 17:39.760
and she faced

17:39.840 --> 17:42.480
the constant threat of being sacrificed.

17:43.680 --> 17:44.800
If that were the case,

17:45.880 --> 17:47.200
would you still take her back?

17:48.560 --> 17:51.160
Homeland is supposed to bring happiness.

17:52.600 --> 17:57.600
If returning meant misfortune,

17:58.120 --> 17:59.200
then don't go back.

18:07.880 --> 18:09.680
Sir…

18:11.400 --> 18:12.400
Did I…

18:13.360 --> 18:15.240
say something wrong?

18:18.600 --> 18:20.240
It's nothing. You may go now.

18:21.440 --> 18:22.480
Understood.

18:22.560 --> 18:23.440
Oh, and…

18:24.160 --> 18:25.080
The pastries…

18:27.040 --> 18:28.160
Thank you, Sir.

18:39.920 --> 18:43.120
GRACEFUL PALACE

18:58.440 --> 19:00.440
Zhao Ming, you're here.

19:01.760 --> 19:02.600
It's been a few days.

19:02.680 --> 19:04.640
I came to see
how your studies are progressing.

19:05.160 --> 19:06.640
Of course, I've been diligent.

19:10.480 --> 19:11.760
Here's a new character I've learned.

19:12.440 --> 19:13.720
The teacher said,

19:13.800 --> 19:16.280
"Sun on the left, moon on the right,
both bring light, making 'ming'."

19:18.920 --> 19:19.920
He teaches well.

19:20.960 --> 19:23.280
But my understanding
is a little different.

19:24.200 --> 19:25.520
Like the sun's brilliance,

19:25.600 --> 19:28.000
like the moon's gentleness,

19:29.400 --> 19:32.840
"sun" and "moon" together
make the "ming" in Zhao Ming.

19:35.000 --> 19:36.200
Your interpretation

19:36.960 --> 19:37.800
is also reasonable.

19:39.440 --> 19:41.200
MING

19:41.280 --> 19:42.840
How do you think my writing looks?

19:50.240 --> 19:51.840
Your writing is good,

19:52.480 --> 19:53.600
but…

19:54.120 --> 19:55.040
the parts are a bit distant.

19:55.120 --> 19:56.760
Distant?

20:00.720 --> 20:02.840
Then I'll make it closer!

20:17.320 --> 20:18.400
Zhao Ming,

20:19.400 --> 20:20.480
am I considered a beauty?

20:26.640 --> 20:27.880
Does that mean I'll have a tragic fate?

20:29.720 --> 20:31.200
I heard they say
beauties have tragic fates.

20:33.560 --> 20:34.400
No.

20:35.560 --> 20:37.200
You will live a long, long life,

20:37.800 --> 20:38.680
longer than mine.

20:38.760 --> 20:40.640
Longer than yours?

20:42.480 --> 20:43.920
What's the point of that?

20:44.440 --> 20:46.040
I'm your pearl,

20:46.560 --> 20:48.120
so I should always stay with you.

20:48.200 --> 20:51.000
I exist because you exist, right?

20:51.080 --> 20:51.960
No,

20:52.040 --> 20:54.000
you don't exist because of me,

20:54.080 --> 20:57.120
and your purpose isn't tied to me either.

20:58.320 --> 21:00.600
Time is long, with gains
and losses coming and going.

21:01.320 --> 21:02.480
Someday,

21:03.160 --> 21:05.760
you'll find your own path
and your own purpose.

21:06.520 --> 21:08.520
My own path,

21:09.800 --> 21:11.560
my own purpose…

21:14.360 --> 21:17.040
It's okay.
There's no rush to figure it out now.

21:17.560 --> 21:18.400
The future is long.

21:24.600 --> 21:26.800
I may not know what my path is,

21:27.400 --> 21:28.720
but I know yours.

21:30.160 --> 21:31.400
You're the Saint Emperor,

21:32.120 --> 21:33.640
with the world on your mind.

21:34.360 --> 21:36.760
So, your path is the Emperor's Way.

21:38.760 --> 21:40.440
The Emperor's Way is not what I seek.

21:41.840 --> 21:42.960
What I want

21:43.480 --> 21:45.840
is to be a man of courage,

21:45.920 --> 21:48.600
unbound by heaven, protecting humanity,

21:48.680 --> 21:49.720
and breaking through heaven itself.

21:52.520 --> 21:54.960
MAN

21:56.840 --> 21:58.200
The teacher said

21:58.280 --> 22:00.000
"heaven" has two extra strokes
over "human,"

22:00.080 --> 22:01.640
firmly trapping it beneath.

22:02.240 --> 22:03.880
But under your pen,

22:04.600 --> 22:05.680
humanity can break through heaven?

22:05.760 --> 22:07.720
Man makes his own destiny.

22:10.520 --> 22:11.640
Zhao Ming,

22:12.280 --> 22:13.720
I don't fully understand.

22:14.480 --> 22:17.120
What exactly is humanity?

22:26.200 --> 22:30.480
Humanity is both simple and complex.

22:30.560 --> 22:33.520
HUMAN

22:34.680 --> 22:36.160
It seems weak at first glance,

22:37.120 --> 22:38.280
but it can possess great strength.

22:40.400 --> 22:42.480
Just looking at it on paper
won't reveal its essence.

22:44.160 --> 22:46.760
To understand humanity,
you must use your heart.

22:49.240 --> 22:50.160
Heart?

22:53.440 --> 22:55.080
To understand a person,

22:55.800 --> 22:57.360
you can't only look at their appearance.

22:58.200 --> 22:59.640
You must also see their inner self.

23:00.320 --> 23:01.720
Look at what they say

23:02.240 --> 23:03.720
and at what they do.

23:04.640 --> 23:05.960
See their strengths

23:06.480 --> 23:07.680
but also their weaknesses.

23:08.880 --> 23:10.560
See how they treat themselves

23:11.320 --> 23:13.040
and how they treat others.

23:13.760 --> 23:15.720
Observe their grace in good times

23:16.520 --> 23:18.400
and their choices in adversity.

23:21.520 --> 23:22.360
Humanity

23:22.880 --> 23:24.800
cannot be explained in a few words.

23:25.320 --> 23:26.800
If you wish to understand it,

23:27.680 --> 23:29.080
I will take you to see it carefully
in the future.

23:34.120 --> 23:35.240
Your Grace,

23:35.320 --> 23:37.480
we've searched the human realm
for a long time

23:37.560 --> 23:39.280
but still haven't found the divine child.

23:40.600 --> 23:42.560
The prophecy gives limited clues,

23:42.640 --> 23:45.240
making the search
like finding a needle in a haystack.

23:46.920 --> 23:49.720
If you ask me,
even if the prophecy is true,

23:49.800 --> 23:52.520
are we, so many deities,
unable to defeat a single divine child?

23:54.400 --> 23:57.320
The Book of Fate
governs all cause and effect.

23:57.400 --> 24:00.560
If it reveals a prophecy,
it will become destiny.

24:01.640 --> 24:04.400
Failing in your task
and now trying to argue?

24:04.480 --> 24:06.320
Your Grace, calm your anger.

24:07.960 --> 24:11.200
Our travels across the nations
have not been entirely fruitless.

24:15.560 --> 24:18.200
Dongze stands as the world's leader,

24:18.760 --> 24:21.800
with all nations and tribes
under its governance.

24:21.880 --> 24:24.120
The ruler of Dongze, Zhao Ming,

24:24.200 --> 24:26.400
is exceptional,
a man of unparalleled brilliance.

24:26.480 --> 24:29.400
If we can bring Zhao Ming
under your command,

24:29.480 --> 24:32.280
the search for the divine child
would greatly benefit.

24:33.760 --> 24:35.480
Regarding the prophecy
of the divine child,

24:35.560 --> 24:37.640
I suddenly have a theory.

24:37.720 --> 24:40.280
The so-called birth of the divine child
might have occurred ten years ago,

24:40.360 --> 24:42.440
at the very moment when the Book of Fate

24:42.520 --> 24:43.840
revealed the prophecy.

24:45.440 --> 24:46.760
Why not

24:46.840 --> 24:49.880
start searching
among the children born at that time?

24:51.120 --> 24:52.160
That makes sense.

24:53.200 --> 24:55.080
Continue searching the lower realms,

24:55.600 --> 24:57.920
and send another divine edict to Dongze,

24:58.640 --> 25:01.440
instructing Zhao Ming
to offer up the children.

25:02.840 --> 25:06.040
But Your Grace,
so many children were born at that time.

25:06.880 --> 25:08.880
What if… What if
we can't identify the divine child?

25:09.640 --> 25:11.200
Then kill them all.

25:11.280 --> 25:12.920
Leave no one alive.

25:14.000 --> 25:16.000
In the year of Cang Hao,

25:16.080 --> 25:19.760
3,000 children were born.

25:19.840 --> 25:21.200
Summon them as divine servants.

25:22.560 --> 25:23.480
Sir,

25:24.000 --> 25:25.480
is this a newly descended divine edict?

25:27.640 --> 25:29.160
The year of Cang Hao…

25:30.040 --> 25:31.440
Isn't that ten years ago?

25:33.080 --> 25:36.000
That year, the heavens were torn open.

25:36.080 --> 25:37.160
Placing humanity
on the brink of extinction.

25:37.800 --> 25:41.000
The late emperor
also perished in that crisis.

25:42.160 --> 25:43.080
Sir,

25:43.880 --> 25:44.800
what should we do now?

25:47.600 --> 25:49.920
As an advisor,
upon receiving a divine edict,

25:50.000 --> 25:51.760
it is my duty to report it
to the Saint Emperor.

25:52.720 --> 25:54.040
How to decide

25:56.120 --> 25:58.040
is up to the Saint Emperor.

25:58.120 --> 25:59.240
Nonsense!

26:01.480 --> 26:03.840
The deities now even target children.

26:04.920 --> 26:06.560
They use the guise of divine servants

26:06.640 --> 26:08.160
to force humanity
into sacrificing those children.

26:08.240 --> 26:10.280
With just a so-called divine edict,

26:10.360 --> 26:11.800
they want to take 3,000 lives.

26:12.440 --> 26:14.200
As long as I, Zhao Ming, live,

26:15.160 --> 26:16.360
I will never bow to the deities.

26:17.880 --> 26:19.760
Sir, please destroy the tortoise shell.

26:20.280 --> 26:21.600
From today onward,

26:22.120 --> 26:23.440
Dongze will no longer accept
any divine edicts.

26:24.040 --> 26:25.120
Your Majesty,

26:26.080 --> 26:26.920
have you made up your mind?

26:28.800 --> 26:30.240
The deities are merciless,

26:30.320 --> 26:31.400
and their oppression worsens.

26:31.480 --> 26:32.800
Now,

26:33.320 --> 26:35.240
we must hasten to find a way
to resist the deities.

26:35.320 --> 26:37.600
The power gap between humans and deities

26:38.200 --> 26:41.760
makes resistance
like bringing a knife to a gunfight.

26:41.840 --> 26:43.520
But I believe

26:44.120 --> 26:45.200
humanity can triumph over heaven!

26:52.800 --> 26:54.240
Then, may Your Majesty

26:55.600 --> 26:56.560
achieve your wishes.

27:13.480 --> 27:14.360
What are you doing here?

27:15.720 --> 27:17.000
Bad He Zhou,

27:17.080 --> 27:18.400
you scared me again!

27:22.200 --> 27:24.160
Did you already buy
the new storybooks for me?

27:25.520 --> 27:27.480
I got these rare editions

27:27.560 --> 27:30.160
through countless connections
and Herculean efforts!

27:30.800 --> 27:32.000
So,

27:32.080 --> 27:34.640
don't you think I deserve a little extra
for the trouble?

27:35.160 --> 27:36.240
I think

27:36.320 --> 27:37.680
your bracelet looks pretty nice.

27:39.240 --> 27:41.760
I already paid you for the storybooks.

27:41.840 --> 27:43.160
You're trying to trick me again.

27:44.040 --> 27:46.040
Well, it's your fault
for learning so quickly,

27:46.120 --> 27:47.760
reading three books a day!

27:47.840 --> 27:50.120
I might run my legs off
to keep up with your demands!

27:50.640 --> 27:51.600
Besides,

27:52.120 --> 27:53.800
this batch of storybooks

27:53.880 --> 27:55.760
is different from the mythology
you've been reading.

27:56.600 --> 27:57.560
These ones

27:57.640 --> 27:59.120
are about love stories.

28:00.720 --> 28:01.680
Love stories?

28:04.680 --> 28:05.520
Don't tease me.

28:17.880 --> 28:19.440
Have you all had your fill?

28:21.240 --> 28:22.320
How about a story?

28:22.840 --> 28:24.600
-Yes!
-Let's hear it!

28:25.120 --> 28:28.080
Today's story is perfect for all of you.

28:28.160 --> 28:31.520
It's about a poor fisher girl

28:31.600 --> 28:33.840
falling in love with a prince in disguise

28:33.920 --> 28:36.040
and eventually becoming a royal consort.

28:36.560 --> 28:40.120
Next, let's invite the palace's well-read

28:40.200 --> 28:42.240
and story-loving Pearl

28:42.320 --> 28:43.520
to share this tale with us.

28:44.120 --> 28:45.800
-Yes!
-Great!

28:48.600 --> 28:49.720
Listen closely now.

28:51.320 --> 28:53.440
A long, long time ago,

28:53.520 --> 28:54.840
there was a kind-hearted fisher girl.

28:54.920 --> 28:56.080
While out fishing,

28:56.680 --> 28:59.600
she accidentally rescued
a badly injured man.

28:59.680 --> 29:02.120
The fisher girl's elder sister
found out about this

29:02.200 --> 29:03.400
and warned her,

29:03.480 --> 29:06.920
"Never pick up men randomly
from the roadside,

29:07.000 --> 29:08.880
especially injured ones.

29:08.960 --> 29:10.760
They'll bring misfortune."

29:10.840 --> 29:13.440
But the fisher girl thought it over
and said,

29:13.520 --> 29:15.680
"I didn't pick him up by the roadside.

29:15.760 --> 29:17.640
I fished him out of the sea!"

29:18.480 --> 29:20.440
Pearl always brings laughter and joy.

29:20.520 --> 29:22.440
-What do you think?
-Since she was here,

29:22.520 --> 29:24.800
this once-quiet Everbright Palace

29:25.320 --> 29:26.560
has become full of life.

29:27.480 --> 29:28.360
Indeed.

29:29.040 --> 29:30.600
The servants all adore her.

29:33.920 --> 29:34.800
Would you like to go in and see?

29:36.840 --> 29:37.880
Listen.

29:37.960 --> 29:38.920
-If I go in…
-I will tell another story,

29:39.000 --> 29:40.920
-which is a lot funnier.
-Sure!

29:41.000 --> 29:42.120
-…they won't enjoy themselves as much.
-Off you go then.

29:42.200 --> 29:43.160
Tell us!

29:43.240 --> 29:44.080
-Let's take care of business first.
-Tell us!

29:44.160 --> 29:45.760
How can it be?

30:21.200 --> 30:22.480
Over the years,

30:23.400 --> 30:24.880
I've traveled far and wide,

30:25.680 --> 30:27.360
researching ways
to resist the Divine Clan.

30:28.160 --> 30:30.160
It is said that only something
greater than them

30:30.240 --> 30:31.960
can suppress them.

30:32.560 --> 30:35.440
One such thing are two ancient artifacts,
the Book of Fate and the Chaos Pearl.

30:37.000 --> 30:37.920
The other

30:39.160 --> 30:41.120
is the Jun Tian Sword,

30:41.840 --> 30:43.600
born of the energy of the chaos.

30:45.160 --> 30:46.440
You've searched three times yourself

30:46.960 --> 30:48.440
following this map,

30:48.960 --> 30:50.640
and every time,
the end leads to an empty void.

30:50.720 --> 30:51.640
There is no sword at all.

30:51.720 --> 30:53.040
Could it be

30:53.600 --> 30:54.640
that the map is wrong?

30:57.640 --> 30:58.480
No,

31:00.120 --> 31:01.200
the map must be true.

31:02.480 --> 31:03.960
Each time I reach the destination,

31:04.040 --> 31:05.440
I can feel the intense sword energy.

31:05.520 --> 31:07.400
Perhaps my approach is wrong,

31:08.080 --> 31:09.400
so the Jun Tian Sword remains hidden.

31:10.000 --> 31:13.240
Yan, seek out the best swordsmiths.

31:13.320 --> 31:15.720
-See if they might uncover something new.
-Understood.

31:22.000 --> 31:23.200
If the Jun Tian Sword cannot be found,

31:24.160 --> 31:25.920
won't you truly consider

31:26.000 --> 31:28.160
using the Chaos Pearl
against the Divine Clan?

31:38.160 --> 31:40.120
The Chaos Pearl
has already mended the heavens,

31:41.400 --> 31:43.360
bearing the weight of the world once.

31:44.640 --> 31:46.160
Now that it's no longer functional,

31:47.720 --> 31:49.880
I'd rather let it live
a simple and happy life as Pearl.

31:53.040 --> 31:54.760
As for opposing the Divine Clan,

31:55.280 --> 31:56.640
that is my responsibility.

31:56.720 --> 31:58.200
Besides,

31:59.560 --> 32:01.320
if the Divine Clan descends
to the human realm,

32:01.840 --> 32:03.360
their divine power will be restricted.

32:04.600 --> 32:06.320
Even in direct confrontation,

32:07.160 --> 32:10.440
I can still match them with my power.

32:10.520 --> 32:12.880
But you've already lost a drop
of your blood essence,

32:13.480 --> 32:15.160
and the methods you seek
only weaken you further.

32:15.240 --> 32:16.840
It's just a single drop of blood essence.

32:17.360 --> 32:18.240
I'm far from weak.

32:26.960 --> 32:30.320
How dare Zhao Ming
destroy the divine edict!

32:30.920 --> 32:32.760
I might as well kill him outright!

32:32.840 --> 32:34.560
If it were so easy to kill him,

32:34.640 --> 32:36.640
why wait until now?

32:44.720 --> 32:46.880
Zhao Ming was born with divine channels.

32:46.960 --> 32:50.080
He's the only human capable
of cultivating divine power.

32:50.160 --> 32:53.240
He is the leader of the human race,
respected and supported by all.

32:53.840 --> 32:57.080
He carries an endless flow
of sovereign fortune,

32:57.720 --> 33:00.760
making it impossible to kill him directly.

33:01.640 --> 33:04.280
Moreover, the divine order must be upheld.

33:04.360 --> 33:06.920
If you use divine power
in the human realm,

33:07.000 --> 33:09.480
your strength
will be significantly reduced.

33:11.120 --> 33:12.720
Mortals are driven
by desires and emotions.

33:13.360 --> 33:15.120
Zhao Ming must have a weakness.

33:15.720 --> 33:18.240
His weakness isn't within himself.

33:18.320 --> 33:19.920
It's in maintaining
the peace of the world.

33:20.440 --> 33:21.800
If he refuses the divine edict,

33:21.880 --> 33:24.560
do you think the other nations
will also dare to defy it?

33:25.360 --> 33:27.440
It's better to stir chaos
in the human realm

33:27.520 --> 33:29.400
and send him a warning.

33:30.280 --> 33:31.720
When unrest shakes the world,

33:31.800 --> 33:35.040
I want to see how Zhao Ming
remains above it all.

33:35.640 --> 33:36.560
Exactly.

33:37.200 --> 33:38.760
You and I are deities of desire,

33:39.440 --> 33:41.600
masters of manipulating the human heart.

33:42.680 --> 33:44.400
If we descend divine edicts
upon the nations

33:45.160 --> 33:46.840
and tempt them to fight over resources,

33:47.560 --> 33:49.040
war will inevitably break out.

33:49.120 --> 33:52.360
Countless mortals will perish in battle.

33:52.440 --> 33:54.360
Zhao Ming
will have no choice but to submit!

33:55.280 --> 33:57.120
Then get it done at once.

33:58.080 --> 33:58.920
I want to see

33:59.000 --> 34:01.080
Zhao Ming weakened,

34:01.960 --> 34:03.720
his sovereign pride shattered.

34:05.200 --> 34:06.480
Within half a month,

34:07.000 --> 34:08.800
all the nations have gone to war.

34:09.679 --> 34:11.320
Something suspicious is at play.

34:12.320 --> 34:15.480
Indeed. Even Xilin State,
which has always been wary of war,

34:16.000 --> 34:17.920
has suddenly fallen into chaos.

34:19.719 --> 34:21.360
What is the situation on the borders?

34:21.440 --> 34:23.159
After your orders,

34:23.239 --> 34:24.800
the border soldiers
have raised their guard.

34:24.880 --> 34:27.320
However, many refugees
are running to Dongze,

34:27.840 --> 34:29.199
placing significant pressure on us.

34:37.840 --> 34:40.719
The world is meant to be united,
with no divisions between us and them.

34:41.840 --> 34:43.800
He Zhou, issue an order

34:43.880 --> 34:45.639
to take good care of these refugees.

34:46.880 --> 34:47.840
Additionally,

34:48.480 --> 34:49.719
starting today,

34:49.800 --> 34:51.480
beginning with Everbright Palace,

34:51.560 --> 34:53.280
all living expenses shall be kept simple.

34:53.360 --> 34:55.560
-Use the savings to support the refugees.
-Understood.

34:55.639 --> 34:57.680
Yan, investigate this chaos immediately

34:57.760 --> 34:59.320
and uncover the cause behind it.

34:59.400 --> 35:00.240
Understood.

35:00.760 --> 35:04.080
EVERBRIGHT PALACE

35:37.000 --> 35:37.840
Come in.

35:41.520 --> 35:42.600
Sir.

35:43.760 --> 35:44.840
What brings you here?

35:46.000 --> 35:47.600
Can you tell me

35:48.320 --> 35:49.680
about Zhao Ming's past?

35:52.160 --> 35:53.200
Why do you ask?

35:53.840 --> 35:55.720
Although Zhao Ming is warm and kind,

35:56.240 --> 35:58.880
there's always a mysterious feeling
about him.

35:58.960 --> 36:00.120
Lately,

36:00.640 --> 36:02.760
even his smiles carry a hint of sorrow,

36:03.280 --> 36:06.240
as if there's
an invisible chain holding him down.

36:06.920 --> 36:08.440
That's why I want to know

36:09.880 --> 36:11.280
what he has been through

36:11.360 --> 36:13.480
and what burdens he carries.

36:17.480 --> 36:18.840
DONGZE

36:19.920 --> 36:22.640
This contains the story
of Dongze's current dynasty,

36:23.400 --> 36:25.120
which is also Zhao Ming's biography.

36:25.920 --> 36:26.800
Ten years ago,

36:27.800 --> 36:30.400
Dongze's former emperor perished
in a heavenly crisis.

36:30.480 --> 36:32.400
Zhao Ming, still a youth,

36:33.000 --> 36:35.760
took on the immense responsibility
of the entire realm.

36:35.840 --> 36:37.800
Born with divine channels,

36:38.320 --> 36:39.720
he is brave and skilled in battle.

36:39.800 --> 36:40.920
Before coming of age,

36:41.000 --> 36:42.560
he led armies to the battlefield,

36:43.360 --> 36:45.240
defeating invasions from other nations

36:45.320 --> 36:46.760
and stabilizing the state.

36:47.800 --> 36:49.320
Zhao Ming governs diligently
for his people,

36:49.400 --> 36:50.920
earning deep love from his subjects.

36:51.440 --> 36:52.760
The world aligns with his rule.

36:52.840 --> 36:55.720
The people honor him as the Saint Emperor.

37:00.440 --> 37:02.480
With humanity oppressed
by the Divine Clan,

37:03.120 --> 37:04.720
Zhao Ming swore an oath

37:05.240 --> 37:06.880
to protect the people,

37:06.960 --> 37:08.640
even if it meant sacrificing his life.

37:11.160 --> 37:12.200
So,

37:13.640 --> 37:15.560
what binds Zhao Ming
is not a single chain,

37:17.600 --> 37:19.240
but the weight of all the people
in the world.

37:21.520 --> 37:23.360
Everyone calls him the Saint Emperor,

37:23.440 --> 37:25.840
but behind that noble title

37:26.360 --> 37:28.480
lies their admiration and reliance.

37:30.080 --> 37:31.680
They all depend on him,

37:32.640 --> 37:34.360
but who can he depend on?

37:35.800 --> 37:37.360
He must be so tired.

37:37.920 --> 37:39.680
Rather than calling him Saint Emperor,

37:40.840 --> 37:42.760
I'd rather call him Zhao Ming,

37:43.880 --> 37:46.080
his true self.

37:47.920 --> 37:51.440
Everyone should bear
the consequences of their choices.

37:52.360 --> 37:54.760
This is the destiny he chose for himself.

37:54.840 --> 37:56.040
Destiny?

37:59.920 --> 38:00.880
Today,

38:01.720 --> 38:03.280
I will teach you the character "Zhao."

38:04.640 --> 38:05.920
"Zhao,"

38:06.840 --> 38:07.960
on the left is the "sun,"

38:08.040 --> 38:09.800
shining like the noonday sun,

38:09.880 --> 38:11.280
bringing light to all beings.

38:11.360 --> 38:12.760
Above is a "blade,"

38:12.840 --> 38:14.000
and below is a "mouth"…

38:14.080 --> 38:14.920
ZHAO

38:15.000 --> 38:17.000
…symbolizing the danger

38:17.720 --> 38:19.240
of living on the edge of death.

38:20.360 --> 38:21.400
Sir, are you saying

38:21.480 --> 38:22.760
that Zhao Ming will die?

38:25.960 --> 38:27.760
The Saint Emperor was born
with divine channels

38:27.840 --> 38:29.480
and is destined
to share heaven's longevity.

38:29.560 --> 38:30.400
How could he die?

38:31.440 --> 38:32.960
I've spoken too much today.

38:33.760 --> 38:35.240
Fate is mysterious,

38:35.880 --> 38:37.960
not something we can easily reveal.

38:40.200 --> 38:41.440
You scared me!

38:42.040 --> 38:43.200
As long as Zhao Ming is fine,
I'm relieved.

38:43.840 --> 38:45.000
You're so knowledgeable,

38:45.080 --> 38:47.760
always saying things too profound for me
to understand.

38:48.840 --> 38:51.520
I have one more profound question

38:51.600 --> 38:52.960
to ask you, Sir.

38:54.640 --> 38:55.480
Go ahead.

38:55.560 --> 38:56.880
What is love?

38:58.080 --> 39:00.880
In storybooks, the woodcutter
and the Divine Saintess fell in love.

39:01.400 --> 39:04.160
Even when they turned into stone,
unable to be together,

39:04.240 --> 39:06.000
they felt no regret.

39:07.240 --> 39:09.120
I want to know, what exactly is love?

39:09.720 --> 39:12.680
Is love a desire or a driving force?

39:13.480 --> 39:14.520
In your opinion,

39:15.040 --> 39:16.280
what is love?

39:17.160 --> 39:18.920
Why is it that when humans have love,

39:19.000 --> 39:20.680
their lives become bustling

39:20.760 --> 39:21.960
and full of warmth?

39:22.480 --> 39:24.680
If we could also have love,

39:25.880 --> 39:27.240
wouldn't the divine realm

39:27.320 --> 39:28.480
be less cold and desolate?

39:31.120 --> 39:32.920
You and I were created
as divine artifacts,

39:33.800 --> 39:35.560
meant to follow Hao Tian's will.

39:36.080 --> 39:37.440
To question love

39:37.960 --> 39:39.480
is to begin the path to destruction.

39:44.560 --> 39:45.600
Alright,

39:45.680 --> 39:47.040
then I won't ask anymore.

39:48.120 --> 39:49.760
Anyway, you're by my side.

39:50.400 --> 39:51.600
As long as the sun rises and sets

39:52.120 --> 39:53.480
and the universe endures,

39:54.520 --> 39:55.360
Fate,

39:56.360 --> 39:57.840
we will always be together.

39:59.720 --> 40:01.960
I don't know what love truly is.

40:05.640 --> 40:07.200
All I know is that love…

40:08.560 --> 40:10.560
belongs only to humans

40:11.920 --> 40:13.440
and not to the Divine Saintess.

40:15.120 --> 40:16.640
If a divine saintess loves,

40:18.200 --> 40:19.600
she will be punished by the heavens.

40:23.280 --> 40:26.360
So, even being a divine saintess
isn't easy.

40:30.920 --> 40:32.520
What if…

40:34.000 --> 40:37.280
you're also a celestial pearl
that fell from the heavens?

40:39.480 --> 40:41.840
How could I be a celestial pearl?

40:42.640 --> 40:45.480
I'm just an ordinary pearl
in Zhao Ming's hands.

40:46.000 --> 40:47.600
As long as I can see him every day,

40:47.680 --> 40:48.760
stay with him every day,

40:49.280 --> 40:50.360
I'm happy.

40:51.440 --> 40:53.280
But you're a pearl,

40:54.440 --> 40:55.760
and he's human.

40:57.640 --> 40:59.680
You're destined to be separated one day.

40:59.760 --> 41:00.640
No, we won't.

41:01.320 --> 41:03.440
Look, in the storybooks,

41:03.520 --> 41:05.400
the woodcutter may have turned to stone,

41:05.920 --> 41:07.920
but his heart still loved
the Divine Saintess.

41:08.440 --> 41:10.360
Nothing can truly separate them.

41:11.640 --> 41:13.080
Just like me and Zhao Ming.

41:13.600 --> 41:15.560
As long as I keep him in my heart,

41:16.320 --> 41:18.400
we will never be apart.

41:19.920 --> 41:20.800
No matter what happens,

41:22.200 --> 41:24.320
I will stay by his side, forever.

41:27.320 --> 41:28.360
Forever…

41:35.920 --> 41:39.600
EVERBRIGHT PALACE

42:26.440 --> 42:28.240
Here, the lights shine bright every night.

42:28.760 --> 42:31.800
Affairs of state never seem to end.

42:32.520 --> 42:33.960
Even when you find rest,

42:34.760 --> 42:35.880
nightmares haunt your sleep.

42:37.360 --> 42:38.280
Zhao Ming,

42:39.000 --> 42:41.160
is this your path as the Saint Emperor?

42:41.880 --> 42:42.960
Even a good night's rest

42:43.880 --> 42:45.320
is a luxury.

43:32.800 --> 43:33.760
Your Majesty.

43:47.600 --> 43:48.840
For some reason,

43:49.920 --> 43:51.400
as long as you're by my side,

43:52.600 --> 43:54.360
no matter how overwhelming life gets,

43:54.440 --> 43:57.400
I can still find peace and focus.
